    "title": "<p>Recommended workup for myeloid neoplasm post cytotoxic therapy, for diagnostic purposes, prognostication, and therapeutic decision-making</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Rashmi Kanagal-Shamanna",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 692.9pt; background: #daeef3; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"924\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 692.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"924\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><a name=\"_Hlk140241852\"></a><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: black;\">Bone marrow aspiration and biopsy</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 692.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"924\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: black;\">Flow cytometry immunophenotyping</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 692.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"924\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: black;\">Karyotyping using conventional cytogenetics +/&minus; FISH studies (including determination of <em>TP53</em> allele state) as needed</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 692.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"924\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: black;\">Testing for copy-neutral loss of heterozygosity (specifically for determination of <em>TP53</em> allele state) using SNP arrays or NGS-based analysis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 692.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"924\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: black;\">NGS-based mutation analysis using a broad gene panel including genes implicated in all myeloid malignancies to identify targets for therapy</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 692.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"924\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><em><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: black;\">FLT3</span></em><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;ITD analysis using PCR and capillary electrophoresis or any other suitable method</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 692.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"924\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color: black;\">If an underlying germline predisposition is suspected: see main text</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">ITD, internal tandem duplication; NGS, next-generation sequencing.</span></p>",
